From f74edadd53aaa6c1938b12b9e526b039bbe7f04d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vkd3d-crossover <noreply@vkd3d-crossover.invalid>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:12:12 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] chore(dev): add always-on failure log

Problem: Games failed silently (black screen, E_FAIL/E_OUTOFMEMORY) with nothing pointing at the cause.

Root cause: Diagnostics only; no defect.

Fix: mvkLogFailure()/mvkFailureLogEnabled() append one deduplicated line per event to $WINEPREFIX/drive_c/gfx-failures.log (shared with vkd3d-proton). MoltenVK errors/warnings are mirrored; draw-skipped/dispatch-skipped (compute pipelines keep their shader code hash), gpu-error, device-lost, draw-mismatch (attachment variants), deferred-pso compile failures, swapchain creation lines, and a black-frame detector on present (4x4 grid every 30 presents; MVK_PRESENT_PROBE_LOG=1 adds present-sample lines).

Verified by: Lines from both layers on the PRAGMATA SKETCHBOOK demo; black logo fades detected and recovered; probe7 presented values bit-exact.

Off switch: MVK_FAILURE_LOG=0 (or a path)
